dsh-plugin-cc

This repository's plugin layout, command-flow conventions, and job/state
design follow the patterns established by two MIT-licensed Claude Code
plugins:

- xai-org/grok-build-plugin-cc (bridge command surface, detached run-worker
  job model, session lifecycle hooks)
- openai/codex-plugin-cc (unix-socket broker for a shared long-lived agent
  runtime)

All source files in this repository are original implementations written
against the DeepSeek Harness (deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) public CLI and
SDK wire protocol.
